OL,3,AWife of US scholar jailed in China asks
OL,4,ATrump to raise arrest at Xi meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wife of a US scholar imprisoned in
OL,7,FChina on charges of spying and
OL,8,Fendangering national security has asked
OL,9,FPresident Donald Trump to secure his
OL,10,Frelease when he meets Chinese President
OL,11,FXi Jinping at the White House next
OL,12,Fweek.
OL,14,FU Min Zin, the director at a think tank
OL,15,Ffocused on Myanmar, was arrested on 3
OL,16,FJune after travelling to the Chinese
OL,17,Fcity of Kunming for an academic
OL,18,Fconference.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
