OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWife of US scholar jailed in China asks
OL,4,ATrump to raise arrest at Xi meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm deeply hopeful that President
OL,7,FTrump will raise my husband's case with
OL,8,FPresident Xi Jinping at the summit next
OL,9,Fweek," his wife, Sylvia Zin, testified
OL,10,Fto Congress on Wednesday.
OL,12,FXi is due to arrive for a state visit
OL,13,Fto Washington DC on Wednesday. It comes
OL,14,Fafter Xi hosted Trump for a visit to
OL,15,FBeijing in May.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
